  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Urban Productive Safety Net and Jobs Project: World Bank</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide a pathway to economic inclusion for the poorest and addresses gaps in youth unemployment, gender inequality and job search. Given Ethiopia&#x2019;s projected fall in growth, increase in unemployment and overall expected increase in poverty, the project will be an important element of the recovery phase by expanding the urban productive safety net including livelihood recovery support to more households and cities, providing young people with avenues for entering the labor market and strengthen job search services, and by providing urban destitute with essential services. The project therefore provides essential support for Covid-19 affected population during the recovery phase.</narrative>
  </description>
